    "display_name": "Create Your Own",
    "long_instructions": "\r\n## Create Your Own\r\n\r\n**Eligibility Criteria:**\r\n\r\nDesign your own realistic rule that uses **multiple inputs** and includes **all three logical operators**: `!`, `&&`, and `||`.Your rule should describe when someone is **eligible** or **not eligible** for something meaningful.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. Review the available input fields in the starter code, or ask your teacher which fields you can use.\r\n\r\n2. Complete the `eligible()` function so it updates the **message (`message`)** based on your custom eligibility criteria.\r\n\r\n3. In the event handler for the **Run** button (`runBtn`), call `eligible()` to test your rule.\r\n\r\n",
